{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>這款 App 專為想提升英語詞彙量與口語能力的學習者設計。透過人工智能生成的智能單字卡，使用者可以根據自身興趣自訂學習主題，並結合句子練習、發音矯正與單詞遊戲，有效增強記憶。目前正在限時免費，原價 US $3.99。</p>\n<img alt=\"限時免費\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x460x460bb-75-75.webp.pagespeed.ic.QAQC2IChyJ.webp\">\n<h2>核心功能亮點</h2>\n<p>AI Flashcards 能自動從單字庫中產生個人化卡片，省去手動建立時間；Sentence Practice 功能提供日常對話例句，讓學習更貼近真實場景；而 Word Games 包含單詞搜尋、拼字比賽等多種模式，以互動方式鞏固記憶，適合初學到進階三個級別的使用者。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-110-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-111-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.hW4Y8jWDTj.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-112-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1242x2688bb-113-scaled.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/x1242x2688bb-114-scaled.jpg.pagespeed.ic.ZNMkMvAkU3.jpg\">\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/2732x2048bb-1-scaled.jpg\">\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Learn Vocabulary: Smart Vocab</li>\n<li>應用類別：Education</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-21T10:22:35.299900+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}